	Zone forsakenTower, lizardmanTemple, titheFarm, shayzienCrypt, mountKaruulmDungeon, wyrmArea;

	ConditionalStep woodcuttingGuildTask, smeltAddyBarTask, killLizardmanShamanTask, mineLovakiteTask, plantLogavanoTask,
