	QuestStep talkToOlaf, chopTree, giveLogToOlaf, talkToIngrid, talkToVolf, returnToOlaf, useDampPlanks, talkToOlafAfterPlanks, digHole, pickUpKey, searchPainting, doPuzzle, pickUpItems,
