		onBoat, repairedStairs, hasReadPrayerBook, talkedToFenk, talkedToRufus, madeCrateWalls, madeCrateBottom,
		addedCats, addedCatsOrHas10, fenkInCrate, placedKeg, addedFuse, litFuse, churchDoorGone, hasKeg, hasFuse,
